#. Description of the plugin
#: add-to-calendar-from-custom-fields.php
msgid "Turns dates you already store in custom fields (ACF, ACPT or plain post meta) into calendar entries: an .ics file per event, links for Google Calendar and Outlook, a subscribable calendar feed and schema.org event markup for search engines. Works with any theme, with extra dynamic data fields for Breakdance."
msgstr ""

